# Copy to .env (git-ignored) for live runs on the test bot: make live-echo, make live-agent.
# See docs/README.md, "Owner setup for live checks". Never commit the real values.

# Required.
# The test bot's token: @BotFather → /mybots → @test_bot → API Token.
TELEGRAM_TEST_BOT_TOKEN=
# Settings (the admin's Telegram id, models, time zone, limits) live in
# ganglion.local.yaml, not here: copy ganglion.example.yaml to it and set telegram.admin.

# Optional.
# A provider key that `key: env:NAME` in ganglion.local.yaml names; a claude-cli provider, logged
# in, needs none.
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# web.search through Brave; without it, DuckDuckGo (agent.search.mode: auto).
# BRAVE_API_KEY=
